    inlayTitle: 'Inlays & onlays',
    inlayDesc: 'Rebuild only the damaged part of the tooth with high-strength ceramic.',
    crownTitle: 'Crowns',
    crownDesc: 'Cover and protect a badly weakened or broken tooth, restoring its shape and strength.',
    bridgeTitle: 'Bridges',
    bridgeDesc: 'Replace one or more missing teeth by anchoring to the neighbouring teeth.',
    implantTitle: 'Implant-supported prosthetics',
    implantDesc: 'Fixed teeth anchored to implants when several teeth or a full arch are missing.',
    estheticsLead: 'Would you also like to improve colour or shape?',
